          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE\n\nIn this example we are using the Equilateral Triangle to create a repeating mesh, uing the Gradient node as our material.\nBy increasing the UV values we get a repeating patttern on our mesh.\nTry playing the the UV values to see what happens."
          }
        },
