          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EQUILATERAL TRIANGLE\n\nThe Equilateral Triangle node constructs a triangular geometry with a given size.\n\nThe UV parameters of the node are hidden by default but can be accessed through by right clicking the node and navigating to View.\n\nThe UV inlet takes a Box2D type which can be constructed with the Box2D node or To Box node."
          }
        },
